#Build a docker container
docker build -t binance_stream_job 

#Run the container
docker run -d --name binance_stream_job --env-file .env binance_stream_job

⚡ Monitoring & Maintenance
Start Container: docker start binance_stream_job

Stop Container: docker stop binance_stream_job

View Live Stream Logs: docker logs -f binance_stream_job
